Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不想知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那是什么表情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.69,0:00:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厉害的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:35.49,0:00:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好吧  做一次看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.09,0:00:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试一试 不就知道了\N哥哥 找到你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们玩你先回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.51,0:00:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行我要和大家一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.81,0:01:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妹妹太可爱了吧\N要去KTV吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.72,0:01:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个有点困难\N说什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.03,0:01:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 怎么好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.93,0:01:25.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刚才开始一直被看着\N他吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:28.34,0:01:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被嫌弃了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.75,0:01:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都这样看着人吗\N你很恶心哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:36.15,0:01:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样了 也别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.46,0:01:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊 只看有什么用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.57,0:01:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是怎么回事啊\N就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.37,0:02:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了 来了 来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.88,0:02:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要经过这里啊\N怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.38,0:02:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要乱用我的东西啊\N但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.19,0:02:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们一起用的吧\N才不对 快还给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.09,0:02:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要用吗  当然啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.80,0:02:29.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先让我看你的漫画\N别说这种  快还给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.60,0:02:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁 他妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.01,0:02:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹吗 怎么完全不像啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然有这样的妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.32,0:02:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识吗  快还给我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.33,0:02:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗\N再让我多用一会儿吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可爱啊 你要去哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.14,0:03:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等 稍等\N哥哥 别去 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.04,0:03:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再借我用一会儿吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.95,0:03:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是他妹妹啊 太可爱了\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.35,0:03:26.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字 有男朋友吗\N要一起去玩吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.57,0:03:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不跟你这种轻抚男人说话\N去死吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.78,0:03:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 没事吧 但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.79,0:03:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥是你的错呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.40,0:04:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（我妹妹和你妹妹）\N（究竟谁更淫荡呢）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.32,0:04:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在吗 上厕所了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偷偷拿好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.75,0:04:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,画得真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太色情了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.66,0:05:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人在画色情漫画吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.97,0:05:20.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 别看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.58,0:05:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.09,0:05:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看什么啊 去死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.89,0:05:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.20,0:05:44.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一生气就打人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.50,0:05:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被这样啊 其他人不像我\N那么温柔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.01,0:05:55.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别的男人要是生气起来了\N你怎么办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.21,0:06:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说班上那个轻浮男吗\N那个人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.32,0:06:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,擅自壁咚我 是他不对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.22,0:06:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小心被他报复\N你在担心我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.73,0:06:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄妹啊\N明明你是一个宅男
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.84,0:06:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你耍什么帅呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.44,0:06:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我的笔 还给我\N再进来就杀了你 快滚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在干什么\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.88,0:07:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生气中 生气吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.68,0:07:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.89,0:07:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问问自己的良心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.59,0:07:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是今天惹你生气了吧\N才没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.40,0:07:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是猜中了吧\N才不是 没有猜中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.11,0:07:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 什么 刚刚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.62,0:07:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那么帅 人人都喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.03,0:07:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我会妒忌的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.33,0:08:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你这样我更兴奋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊 哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.25,0:08:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 哥哥被舔啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.16,0:08:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要做更淫荡的事情吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.96,0:08:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.08,0:08:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在画画吗 别看好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是漫画吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.39,0:08:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.19,0:09:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 快还给我 真傻啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷掉好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.81,0:09:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊 哥哥\N你想看哪里吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想看吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.12,0:09:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 没有兴趣吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.53,0:09:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是经常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.03,0:09:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用色情的眼神看着我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.54,0:09:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也想看一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.35,0:09:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有兴趣吗 不喜欢我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.66,0:10:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我的妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.66,0:10:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要交换一下啊\N你说什么呢哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.49,0:10:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  准备好了吗\N准备好了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.70,0:10:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这边也好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.21,0:10:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要磨蹭到什么时候啊\N但是这种事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.12,0:11:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点好吗 好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.12,0:11:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点脱掉不就行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.73,0:11:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 过去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.15,0:11:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手太碍事了 给你绑起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.06,0:11:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做这种事好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.46,0:11:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己想做这种事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.37,0:11:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不想和你做这种事\N不过是哥哥的命令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.98,0:12:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想违反哥哥的命令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.81,0:12:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你很久了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.31,0:12:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前你不是打了我哥哥\N一巴掌吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.22,0:12:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他很生气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.12,0:12:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后还说要报复你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.13,0:13:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N然后你哥哥听到之后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.34,0:13:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟他打架了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.64,0:13:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道会不会出事 怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.95,0:13:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找老师 你先去\N体育室等我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.48,0:13:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要不要把睾丸捏爆 请不要这样\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.69,0:13:59.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不听话就捏爆\N这是哥哥吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.20,0:14:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临 不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.11,0:14:12.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.61,0:14:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实点 我才不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.61,0:14:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就剩下我和你了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.52,0:14:24.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.72,0:14:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱  哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.43,0:14:33.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太卑鄙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.13,0:14:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是被我打过一次了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.83,0:14:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有资格这样说\N不要 别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.04,0:14:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看得清楚吗 没事的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.55,0:14:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就要开始侵犯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.75,0:15:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 不行\N你哥哥真过分啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.16,0:15:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.87,0:15:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以随便干你  什么意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.87,0:15:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.28,0:15:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱 你听我说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.68,0:15:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥不会来救你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.29,0:15:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要看着你们做了\N你在说什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.90,0:15:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啊 你在小瞧我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.51,0:15:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不可以吗\N开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.91,0:16:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.93,0:16:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 放开我\N其实你很像要吧
