Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:05.16,0:45:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 你哥哥这样了\N别看我 小爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:11.47,0:45:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你想要被看吧\N不对 不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:18.67,0:45:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个动作也不害羞吗\N太害羞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:29.18,0:45:33.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把舌头伸出了 快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:53.81,0:45:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都弄脏了 被你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:03.72,0:46:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开心什么 才没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:07.92,0:46:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 继续做吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:15.43,0:46:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰小爱 你闭嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:20.54,0:46:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真多嘴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:28.34,0:46:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,含着这个吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:40.06,0:46:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 首先变成全裸吧\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:47.86,0:46:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱打可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:52.07,0:46:56.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心啊 太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:00.78,0:47:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快脱衣服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:07.68,0:47:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 你看看镜头啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:14.29,0:47:23.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续看吧  小哥哥\N够了 不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:23.90,0:47:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快脱掉吧  磨蹭什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:29.30,0:47:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说宅男真恶心\N这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:35.91,0:47:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别墨迹了 太害羞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:42.22,0:47:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快坐下来 脚放上来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:51.83,0:47:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手呢 死宅男
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:02.94,0:48:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了吗\N你开心什么啊  真变态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:12.55,0:48:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到女生的裸体 很开心吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:21.56,0:48:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:24.86,0:48:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要加油侵犯这个死宅\N这是为了哥哥哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:35.67,0:48:39.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 不要看 闭嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:43.18,0:48:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快含着内裤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:57.29,0:48:58.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开心什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:14.41,0:49:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还活着吗  没有窒息吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:33.33,0:49:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 你是处男吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:40.24,0:49:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是处男啊 对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:43.24,0:49:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定不可能不是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:48.64,0:49:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能有女朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:13.87,0:50:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳头舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:19.57,0:50:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把眼睛张开啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:23.78,0:50:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看的见吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:27.98,0:50:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兴奋吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:48.10,0:50:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳头都硬了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:58.01,0:50:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:02.22,0:51:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:06.72,0:51:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:10.33,0:51:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别摸哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:14.83,0:51:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妹妹被侵犯 你兴奋吧\N不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:30.15,0:51:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:33.15,0:51:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肉棒都硬了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:38.55,0:51:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你解开皮包吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:43.06,0:51:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄开了 你肯定很舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:53.57,0:51:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才硬了吧  不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:00.48,0:52:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样那是怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:07.68,0:52:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是 小爱你快看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:15.49,0:52:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥的肉棒哦\N不要看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:21.80,0:52:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被女孩子侵犯 太可怜了\N不要再摸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:30.21,0:52:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不行 不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:35.91,0:52:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:40.72,0:52:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:42.22,0:52:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了  不行了 要射了\N不行了 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:52.13,0:52:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:00.54,0:53:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的声音太害羞了 你叫什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:07.14,0:53:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样我肯定会发出声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:13.75,0:53:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你做爱的时候怎么办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:38.67,0:53:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龟头怎么样 这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:48.58,0:53:49.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:55.49,0:54:03.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱你哥哥很舒服哦\N不行了 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:03.90,0:54:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射了 要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:10.81,0:54:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟有多敏感啊\N你自己自慰会射吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:16.81,0:54:19.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太痛苦了 痛苦吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:19.51,0:54:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样痛苦吗 要变奇怪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:28.52,0:54:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别摸哪里  你闭嘴吧你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:34.83,0:54:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:44.14,0:54:47.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么接下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:50.45,0:54:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再做更厉害的事情吧\N什么厉害的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:56.75,0:55:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你期待什么呢 站起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:03.96,0:55:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:08.76,0:55:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了哦 哥哥和爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:12.37,0:55:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:15.67,0:55:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你兴奋什么啊 不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:24.68,0:55:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:25.58,0:55:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:31.59,0:55:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:39.39,0:55:44.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么不可以\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:45.40,0:55:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样舔的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:00.12,0:56:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太小了 你能射出来吗\N别这样说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:10.03,0:56:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样舔的话 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:18.43,0:56:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太吵了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:26.84,0:56:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自慰的时候也这么啰嗦吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:31.35,0:56:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太害羞了 说不出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:41.26,0:56:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:57.47,0:56:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:01.38,0:57:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:05.28,0:57:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以这么激烈\N你太啰嗦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:12.19,0:57:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N哥哥  我在加油哦 稍等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:27.50,0:57:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 不可以这样\N要变奇怪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:38.61,0:57:40.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 不行了 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:42.82,0:57:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要射在嘴巴里就饶不了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:49.12,0:57:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍耐不住\N我不想喝其他人的精液
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:58.13,0:58:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:12.25,0:58:21.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 不行了 太激烈了\N要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:21.26,0:58:26.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射了 要射了 真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:27.26,0:58:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射了 别这样\N 你不要射啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:34.77,0:58:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么差不多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:40.48,0:58:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 坐下来吧\N那么 差不多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:48.88,0:58:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,插进来好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:58.49,0:59:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  看什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:07.50,0:59:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥我要脱衣服了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:10.51,0:59:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在恶心的宅男面前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:37.83,0:59:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么啊 你想舔吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:47.44,0:59:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题 要舔吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:52.55,0:59:57.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对着镜头说 你想舔啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:00.66,1:00:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天了 我想舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:05.46,1:00:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吗 他要舔我的胸部\N别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:12.67,1:00:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没办法  虽然我很讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:20.18,1:00:24.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 舌头都渗出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:36.39,1:00:40.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 你看我被其他人舔了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:47.20,1:00:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被嘴巴舔了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:59.21,1:01:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:07.62,1:01:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你第一次舔吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:11.83,1:01:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你平常
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:14.83,1:01:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定用色情的眼光看着我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:35.25,1:01:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么哥哥 我接下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:43.06,1:01:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要被插入了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:44.86,1:01:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被哥哥以外的肉棒插入了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:50.87,1:01:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:58.07,1:01:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了 哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:09.78,1:02:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被哥哥看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:15.79,1:02:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不可以射在里面\N就算你这样说
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:21.80,1:02:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要哥哥以为的精液
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:27.50,1:02:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱 别看\N哥哥 你看到了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:40.12,1:02:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:48.22,1:02:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:02.64,1:03:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了\N被发出恶心的声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:11.65,1:03:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太激烈的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:19.75,1:03:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:24.56,1:03:26.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:26.66,1:03:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 不行了 要射了\N别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:42.58,1:03:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:46.78,1:03:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说不可以射了\N因为太舒服了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:08.40,1:04:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被内射精液了 看得见吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:17.41,1:04:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 别看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:21.62,1:04:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宅男的精液
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:36.33,1:04:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要坐到什么时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:44.74,1:04:46.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快插进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:48.94,1:04:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要等到什么时候啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:56.45,1:05:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 你看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:13.27,1:05:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不准太开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:26.18,1:05:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认真一点动啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:40.30,1:05:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:49.60,1:05:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被宅男侵犯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:58.91,1:06:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥有在看吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:05.82,1:06:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对我只是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:22.04,1:06:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:36.45,1:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用肉棒高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:46.96,1:06:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:55.67,1:06:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:22.40,1:07:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥看好了 不要看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:36.81,1:07:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  小穴湿透了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:44.32,1:07:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点插进来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:17.65,1:08:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认真一点动啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:36.87,1:08:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了 看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:41.38,1:08:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:49.48,1:08:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 被死宅侵犯了\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:55.19,1:08:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:00.60,1:09:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样问我也
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:10.51,1:09:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:15.01,1:09:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 要射了 要射了\N不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:32.13,1:09:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊 又射在里面了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:51.35,1:09:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:54.05,1:09:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被死宅内射了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:59.15,1:10:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是正常位所以我都看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:18.07,1:10:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被哥哥意外的人 内射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:34.29,1:10:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快解开啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:37.29,1:10:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会饶恕你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:41.20,1:10:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别摸啊 还给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:47.50,1:10:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 我可是你哥哥啊\N 一个死宅干什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:56.81,1:11:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来你骗我干什么\N绝对绕不了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:05.22,1:11:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在妒忌我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:09.12,1:11:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能\N我绝对要杀了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:21.14,1:11:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:28.04,1:11:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:37.35,1:11:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:41.86,1:11:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:44.26,1:11:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我会所他妹妹绝对更色情
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:53.27,1:12:00.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 所以我要跟他证明\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:00.48,1:12:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹更淫荡更色情\N证明这种干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:05.28,1:12:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都部淫荡
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:08.28,1:12:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么呢 明明就画色情漫画\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:13.39,1:12:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有关系吧  放开我\N别乱动
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:23.00,1:12:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不听话的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:25.70,1:12:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就把你画的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:27.20,1:12:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有色情漫画书都拿到学校传播
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:36.51,1:12:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么 死宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:39.81,1:12:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然要被其他男人内射
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:45.22,1:12:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 放开我\N啰嗦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:53.33,1:12:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啰嗦 快停下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:05.64,1:13:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:15.25,1:13:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好吃了 看到了吗\N我妹妹的胸部
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:20.66,1:13:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好吃哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:30.57,1:13:37.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里太亮了 不要 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:37.77,1:13:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大家都看看吧 别乱动
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:50.09,1:13:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样\N这小穴太淫荡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:55.19,1:13:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:08.70,1:14:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:21.92,1:14:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 别这样 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:28.82,1:14:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就高潮了 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:34.53,1:14:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是小爱高潮的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:39.63,1:14:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹是最淫荡的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:46.24,1:14:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱 我借了一点好东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:52.85,1:14:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:59.45,1:15:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:11.77,1:15:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:13.87,1:15:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 你要反抗我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:19.57,1:15:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就把你的漫画散播出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:27.68,1:15:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吧 完全
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:30.09,1:15:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不舒服\N这里 这里 你看到了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:38.19,1:15:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 妹妹有感觉的样子 太淫荡了\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:42.10,1:15:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 完全没有感觉 但是\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:46.30,1:15:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说舒服啊  我才不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:50.51,1:15:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要\N这样舒服吧  怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:03.72,1:16:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉害吧  快停下来啊宅男
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:07.62,1:16:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的道具技术厉害吧\N快停下来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:13.93,1:16:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:16.63,1:16:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不舒服\N快说你舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:22.04,1:16:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对着镜头 快说舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:26.84,1:16:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快对着镜头说 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:30.15,1:16:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了你会停下来吗\N快说吧  先说
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:38.25,1:16:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:42.76,1:16:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:44.86,1:16:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:46.96,1:16:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗 那么继续吧\N可以停下来了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:56.57,1:17:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 快停下来\N这里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:06.48,1:17:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上被我弄高潮了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:11.89,1:17:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样  不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:21.50,1:17:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 不要\N要高潮了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:28.70,1:17:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用忍耐哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:34.11,1:17:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:41.92,1:17:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样舒服吧  等等我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:50.63,1:17:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个不错吧  恶心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:56.93,1:17:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对着哥哥说什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:05.34,1:18:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个混账
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:09.24,1:18:10.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:13.15,1:18:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就内射了别人的妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:19.75,1:18:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么所谓\N太不公平了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:23.96,1:18:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁眼在动哦 别看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:28.76,1:18:31.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱动 快放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:33.57,1:18:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看好了哦 我的妹妹的 \N不要 快放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:44.68,1:18:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的不要这样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:50.69,1:18:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的不要 不要 真的不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:59.39,1:19:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对着镜头 快说
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:03.90,1:19:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说你要高潮\N不行 不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:06.90,1:19:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说被哥哥的技术弄高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:12.91,1:19:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:32.73,1:19:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说哥哥的技术好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:37.83,1:19:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥的技术
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:40.24,1:19:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害 对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:46.54,1:19:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续 继续 屁眼让我看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:56.15,1:19:57.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:57.65,1:20:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁眼真漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:08.46,1:20:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:13.57,1:20:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常淫荡哦 小爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:15.97,1:20:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吧  要高潮了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:23.18,1:20:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,淫荡一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:33.39,1:20:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了很多次了吧
