Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:36.27,1:23:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要坏掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:40.78,1:23:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来这边 张开 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:53.09,1:23:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被哥哥的超级技术弄得\N很舒服吧
