Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:01.38,1:27:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你竟然内射其他女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:07.98,1:27:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小穴也好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:10.69,1:27:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱的也好舒服  闭嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:13.99,1:27:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你嫉妒她吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:21.20,1:27:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闭嘴 别这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:27.80,1:27:31.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  因为
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:31.71,1:27:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然你也很可爱 闭嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:36.21,1:27:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:40.12,1:27:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让哥哥内射不了别人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:46.12,1:27:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来让哥哥的精液都射出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:53.03,1:27:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:57.83,1:27:59.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是要做
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:08.04,1:28:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥喜欢被舔乳头吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:19.75,1:28:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都会说吗\N你内射了其他女人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:27.26,1:28:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是没办法吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:40.48,1:28:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要咬乳头 要咬吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:48.28,1:28:49.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拍摄什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:51.59,1:28:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱不会咬哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:00.60,1:29:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可是被你打过耳光的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:06.30,1:29:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个你也嫉妒吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:08.40,1:29:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:15.01,1:29:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉吧 你不给我脱掉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:22.52,1:29:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我脱掉就喜欢你\N真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:35.73,1:29:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱不掉 脱不掉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:46.54,1:29:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉了哦哥哥 喜欢我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:53.75,1:29:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是小爱更舒服呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:55.55,1:29:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啰嗦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:59.15,1:30:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啰嗦吗 啰嗦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:04.26,1:30:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对我会让你更舒服的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:14.47,1:30:20.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是说你不舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:20.48,1:30:21.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:30.99,1:30:33.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经要开始了吗 什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:40.00,1:30:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是因为你被别人内射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:45.10,1:30:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实宅男挺好的\N我可能要忘掉哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:51.71,1:30:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要忘掉吗\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:55.01,1:31:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那你拿着的是什么 不需要吗\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:03.72,1:31:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我超级需要\N是吗 超级需要吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:15.73,1:31:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对我才最舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:27.74,1:31:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱没做过这个呢 好舒服\N真的吗 我让你更舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:40.96,1:31:47.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你更舒服的\N要多射一点哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:50.87,1:31:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能我就不找其他女人了\N真的吗 太开心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:16.69,1:32:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:20.30,1:32:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吗 可以这样吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:25.70,1:32:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己拿着\N自己拿着吗 太害羞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:48.82,1:32:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:00.54,1:33:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍摄到了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:18.85,1:33:26.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很可爱呢\N真的吗 我可爱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:26.96,1:33:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以继续口交的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:30.87,1:33:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是可以口交就好了\N想要口交吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:42.28,1:33:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你口交吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:03.00,1:34:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:21.32,1:34:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和小爱谁更能让你舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:27.32,1:34:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现阶段还不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:03.06,1:35:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:05.76,1:35:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可爱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:14.47,1:35:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥的肉棒好硬
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:23.78,1:35:30.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能更喜欢你呢\N真的吗 我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:30.69,1:35:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:32.19,1:35:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢我吗 当然了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:36.69,1:35:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你舒服的  真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:40.90,1:35:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:47.80,1:35:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:19.93,1:36:22.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射了 可以哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:27.74,1:36:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:46.66,1:36:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥的精液
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:51.47,1:36:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服\N是不是有点太少了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:06.78,1:37:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会发出声音的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:23.90,1:37:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以内射其他人哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:28.40,1:37:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会 绝对哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:33.81,1:37:38.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最喜欢哥哥了 我也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:47.92,1:37:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:50.93,1:37:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:54.23,1:38:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊  快看这个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:13.15,1:38:17.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吧 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:23.66,1:38:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表情太淫荡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:28.16,1:38:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥别这样看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:31.47,1:38:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了 太淫荡了\N等等 你说什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:40.48,1:38:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可爱了吧\N你高潮很多次了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:47.38,1:38:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然被那个插进去了吗\N舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:58.49,1:39:01.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 有感觉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:03.90,1:39:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口交太淫荡了\N哥哥原来你这样拍摄的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:13.81,1:39:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样才会舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:17.41,1:39:19.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有爱就会舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:19.51,1:39:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:23.42,1:39:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我有爱吗\N绝对没有好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:30.93,1:39:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你别这样看啊\N这个好厉害太厉害了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:37.53,1:39:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太恶心了太淫荡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:11.17,1:40:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太淫荡了啊\N你为什么要开灯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:17.17,1:40:20.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样看的更清楚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:21.98,1:40:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那么漂亮 怎么都这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:25.88,1:40:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:29.18,1:40:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太恶心了\N你说什么 我会让你舒服的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:44.50,1:40:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要我的哥哥\N你说什么 我更好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:53.51,1:41:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接吻就湿透了吗\N我才没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:03.72,1:41:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:06.72,1:41:09.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被宅男亲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:12.73,1:41:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:14.23,1:41:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也  看看吧 你太信了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:23.54,1:41:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样说
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:25.04,1:41:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你很有感觉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:30.45,1:41:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你舒服的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:39.45,1:41:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要这样说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:50.57,1:41:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样别张开啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:55.67,1:41:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样 别张开啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:59.87,1:42:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救我 有感觉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:07.08,1:42:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来确认一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:30.21,1:42:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:42.52,1:42:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这里都硬了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:45.82,1:42:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 我讨厌哥哥\N小爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:54.23,1:42:58.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要舔我吧 我才不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:58.43,1:43:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快点舔我啊 等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:01.14,1:43:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不要 你原来想要啊
