Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:53.09,1:44:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 你都没对我做过这个\N你也想要吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:02.40,1:44:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱你也看这边吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:06.90,1:44:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不想看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:15.01,1:44:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥的技术
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:17.71,1:44:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让这里都湿透了\N只是你的唾液吧
