Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:18.61,1:49:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:21.32,1:49:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是嫉妒吧\N我的技术更好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:27.32,1:49:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么把肉棒拿出来了\N因为想要你舔吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:33.03,1:49:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太恶心了 绝对不会
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:36.63,1:49:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊  舔吧 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:40.54,1:49:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舔啊 我又好主意
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:45.34,1:49:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都过来吧 有技术吧 你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:54.05,1:49:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带上这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:59.75,1:50:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来开始吧 真不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:05.46,1:50:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我躺在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:11.47,1:50:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 别让我等啊\N我才不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:18.07,1:50:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:19.87,1:50:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 小爱你要舔吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:26.18,1:50:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:29.18,1:50:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不行吗 从你开始吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:33.09,1:50:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太紧张了 你快点舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:41.20,1:50:45.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是谁吗 太紧张了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:15.43,1:51:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:17.53,1:51:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:23.24,1:51:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服  这是谁在舔啊\N结束了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:32.25,1:51:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还想要啊 下一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:37.05,1:51:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想要更多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:49.06,1:51:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边好像太激烈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:56.87,1:51:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:03.48,1:52:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:09.48,1:52:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的是小爱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:15.19,1:52:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是这边才是爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:21.50,1:52:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的吧 这是谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:24.50,1:52:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  后面猜不到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:34.41,1:52:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始的更好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:38.01,1:52:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:42.82,1:52:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宅男真的太恶心了\N这个声音是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:48.82,1:52:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥过来吧\N小爱 小爱 不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:54.53,1:53:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都可以的话 这个呢\N不要 好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:04.44,1:53:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么样都可以吧\N没有 我也不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:12.55,1:53:16.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 绝对舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:18.85,1:53:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:20.96,1:53:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 让我舒服吧\N我更舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:29.06,1:53:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说我更舒服吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:33.87,1:53:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 要射了 要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:38.67,1:53:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快射吧 好厉害 好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:44.98,1:53:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要高潮了  要高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:47.98,1:53:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快射出来啊 太脏了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:56.99,1:53:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的太浓了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:01.80,1:54:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是每天都在和爱做爱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:04.80,1:54:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才没有好吗\N你也不自慰吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:10.21,1:54:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定每天都在自慰吧\N虽然是这样 但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:20.42,1:54:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有谁都舒服  太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:25.52,1:54:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常舒服 可以解开了吗\N这次还哥哥吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:34.53,1:54:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是很有自信哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:39.03,1:54:41.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有吗  宅男
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:41.44,1:54:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没用了 下来吧\N那么我可以把眼罩脱掉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:46.84,1:54:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以走了 我才不走
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:51.05,1:54:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:54.65,1:54:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥的话就能猜到吧\N可以哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:03.96,1:55:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想要玩这个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:08.76,1:55:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是提示吗 我是小爱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:13.87,1:55:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太狡猾了 我才要\N等等 这是我的哥哥哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:23.78,1:55:26.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么来猜拳决定吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:30.39,1:55:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会是谁呢 这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:34.59,1:55:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想要上去呢\N你刚才也开心过了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:51.41,1:55:52.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在正在换人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:55.67,1:56:56.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:06.48,1:57:08.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也来参加好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:14.59,1:57:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受不了了\N你要怎么样参加啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:22.70,1:57:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:31.41,1:57:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是谁呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:48.22,1:57:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太淫荡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:52.43,1:57:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊\N为什么我必须要自慰
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:57:57.83,1:58:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥谁更好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:58:04.44,1:58:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这边更好吧\N我要多舔一会儿才知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:58:12.85,1:58:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在品尝呢\N你在干什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:58:20.36,1:58:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自慰不就行了\N我一直都在自慰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:58:51.59,1:58:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:00.90,1:59:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你发出声音了吧 舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:07.20,1:59:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了哦 哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:10.81,1:59:13.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你懂了吧 当然
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:14.71,1:59:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始更好的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:18.61,1:59:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答对了哥哥 太开心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:21.62,1:59:28.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会知道啊\N因为会记得小穴的味道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:33.63,1:59:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱\N哥哥来让你舒服\N不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:40.84,1:59:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥更好吧  别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:45.04,1:59:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚高潮完 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:59:59.75,2:00:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:11.47,2:00:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你高潮更快吧  小爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:16.27,2:00:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:19.27,2:00:20.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:21.38,2:00:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你嫉妒吗\N才没有好吗 真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:29.78,2:00:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到你们蒙眼了\N真不错呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:36.99,2:00:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼罩 眼罩
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:41.20,2:00:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:47.80,2:00:49.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看不见对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:57.11,2:01:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害 别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:01:08.52,2:01:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个人都猜一下吧  哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:01:14.83,2:01:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜不到啊 快猜吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:01:17.83,2:01:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:01:26.84,2:01:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我呢 我呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:01:57.47,2:02:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:02:03.48,2:02:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要接吻
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:02:14.29,2:02:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害  太激烈了 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:02:22.40,2:02:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:02:46.72,2:02:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:02:55.13,2:02:58.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害吗 继续
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:02:58.43,2:03:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要更多 还要
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:07.44,2:03:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服 插到子宫了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:20.06,2:03:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以内射哦 哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:24.26,2:03:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都射出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:32.67,2:03:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不是我哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:35.37,2:03:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:40.48,2:03:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥  哥哥 是谁呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:45.88,2:03:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 最喜欢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:03:54.59,2:04:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 继续吧 不要这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:01.20,2:04:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,激烈一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:06.30,2:04:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:16.21,2:04:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服 好喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:20.72,2:04:21.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:23.72,2:04:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,激烈一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:28.22,2:04:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不行呢 不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:46.24,2:04:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服 好舒服 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:51.95,2:04:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要高潮了 被猜错哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:04:59.15,2:05:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比平常的哥哥更激烈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:05:18.67,2:05:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 要高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:05:38.79,2:05:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱你猜是谁 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:05:46.00,2:05:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:05:57.41,2:06:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了  自己猜
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:04.62,2:06:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宅男吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:06.42,2:06:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这边的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:08.82,2:06:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是宅男吗\N-
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:15.43,2:06:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪呢\N我在这边哦 小爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:24.14,2:06:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊 你不是高潮了吗\N哥哥 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:34.05,2:06:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小爱 不要 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:37.05,2:06:40.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以射出来吧  哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:40.96,2:06:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说不是内射其他人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:44.26,2:06:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是惩罚你们猜错了哦\N小爱你竟然会猜错啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:06:50.87,2:06:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了 太害羞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:03.18,2:07:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 是第一次呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:11.29,2:07:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是精液了 笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:17.59,2:07:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:21.80,2:07:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥又射在哪里了\N没办法吧 你都猜错了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:32.61,2:07:40.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊\N什么什么  要继续侵犯你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:40.72,2:07:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太恶心了 没有这种事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:49.72,2:07:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会被你弄高潮的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:07:55.13,2:07:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才明明一直在高潮
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:00.24,2:08:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我以为是自己哥哥\N你不准内射我
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:08.94,2:08:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要继续
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:11.95,2:08:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么踢我
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:14.65,2:08:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才明明在高潮了\N我已经受够了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:25.16,2:08:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:27.86,2:08:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要插进去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:29.36,2:08:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥快插进来\N会是谁的肉棒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:33.57,2:08:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快闭嘴吧  哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:08:46.18,2:08:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 好舒服\N我谁都不喜欢 快点结束吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:09:03.90,2:09:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太激烈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:09:13.81,2:09:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:09:22.52,2:09:24.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:09:59.45,2:10:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要高潮了 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:10:13.57,2:10:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜得出来吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:10:33.09,2:10:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜到了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:10:37.59,2:10:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是 我可是猜到了哦\N你猜到了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:10:47.20,2:10:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  因为经常和哥哥做爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:10:53.51,2:10:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜到了哥哥的肉棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:10:59.51,2:11:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥我还要更多 还要
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:11:06.42,2:11:10.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更深 不行了  哥哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:11:17.23,2:11:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚
